eksita. Laulge naised, laulge neiud.

281
00:28:49.770 --> 00:28:52.745
Keelustage testime oleta,
keelustage.

282
00:28:56.330 --> 00:28:59.430
Pakid paneme pööri.

283
00:28:59.530 --> 00:29:02.005
Mis tähendab pööri?

284
00:29:03.670 --> 00:29:05.580
Minu.

285
00:29:05.680 --> 00:29:08.105
Teie igatsustese.

286
00:29:09.800 --> 00:29:15.850
Viivitamatult, et see loom,
et see loom panna lühema kepi otsa

287
00:29:15.950 --> 00:29:19.870
Kurat, jälle seesama sara.

288
00:29:19.970 --> 00:29:24.590
Sanatooriumi see on puhkus, naised,
