330
00:34:02.440 --> 00:34:05.650
video küsimus
ja sellega lõpebki see voor.

331
00:34:15.590 --> 00:34:18.010
On ju teada,
et kanad munevad mune erineva

332
00:34:18.110 --> 00:34:20.139
