391
00:40:38.750 --> 00:40:41.540
Sinu naeratuses vastab päike.

392
00:40:43.190 --> 00:40:45.540
Võib üsna pea.

393
00:41:21.620 --> 00:41:24.820
Sinu armastus teeb mulle palu.

394
00:41:24.920 --> 00:41:28.180
Sinu kallistusest ga pea

395
00:41:28.280 --> 00:41:29.530
